rozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 95 at 16 59 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number in two parts  Labeled  Right lumpectomy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm red to yellow lumpectomy specimen  with a REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm tan pink overlying skin ellipse containing a central well healed 2 5cm long scar and orienting suture  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm biopsy cavity that is partially coated with clotted hemorrhagic material  The cavity approaches to within 0 4cm of the skin surface  and 0 7cm of the posterior resection margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  Section code  A  Lateral most margin of specimen B  Medial most margin of specimen C  Biopsy cavity at closest point of skin and posterior resection margin D I Remaining biopsy cavity entirely from medial to lateral  ink posterior  J K Representative sections of remaining breast Labeled  Right axillary nodes  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm piece of yellow red fibrofatty tissue containing ten  tan pink to brown  rubbery  lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  Section code  LandM A single lymph node in each cassette N  Two large lymph nodes O  Si