in  E H  Smaller cavity and deep margin  I  Smaller cavity and superior margin  J K  Firm tissue adjacent to the smaller cavity  L  Representative sections from the remainder of the breast  M  Nipple  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unti number  and  additional deep margin  are multiple fragments of fibroadipose tissue aggregating to 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm  entirely submitted in cassette N  Resident  SELIM NASSER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  ADDITIONAL DEEP MARGIN    EXCISION , Absent.
